\f0\b\fs48 \cf2 VMO2 App Library Design System\
\pard\pardeftab720\sl300\sa100\partightenfactor0

\fs21 \cf2 Scope:
\f1\b0  Virgin Media, O2 and Priority apps\uc0\u8232 
\f0\b Role:
\f1\b0  Design systems, component strategy, UX implementation\uc0\u8232 
\f0\b Outcome:
\f1\b0  Made theme application ~93% faster, reducing it from 54+ seconds to under 4 seconds and saving an estimated 5\'966 hours per designer each year.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sl300\sa100\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs27 \cf2 The Challenge\
\pard\pardeftab720\sl300\sa100\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs21 \cf2 Teams were recreating similar components across brands, creating inconsistent states and design-to-development drift. My role was to help shape a scalable cross-brand system, then put it into practice by creating the My O2 App master file and implementing the new variable structure.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sl300\sa100\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs27 \cf2 1. Audited the existing system\
\pard\pardeftab720\sl300\sa100\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs21 \cf2 I helped audit repeated patterns and inconsistent component states across the apps, identifying where components could be consolidated into shared foundations.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sl300\sa100\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs27 \cf2 2. Rebuilt components with Figma Variables\
\pard\pardeftab720\sl300\sa100\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs21 \cf2 I helped rebuild components from atomic foundations using Figma Variables, replacing the slower Tokens Studio workflow with native theming and reducing reliance on third-party tooling.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sl300\sa100\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs27 \cf2 3. Aligned design with development\
\pard\pardeftab720\sl300\sa100\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs21 \cf2 I worked with engineering so component and variable logic reflected how the UI was built, helping reduce gaps between Figma and implementation.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sl300\sa100\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs27 \cf2 4. Implemented the system in My O2 App\
\pard\pardeftab720\sl300\sa100\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs21 \cf2 I created the My O2 App master file and was the first to implement the new Figma Variables into a live app design file. This proved the variable structure could work in practice and created a foundation for migrating components away from Tokens Studio.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sl300\sa100\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs27 \cf2 Outcome\
\pard\pardeftab720\sl300\sa100\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs21 \cf2 Moving to Figma Variables reduced theme application from 54+ seconds to under 4 seconds, making it ~93% faster. Across 7,609 recorded component inserts, this was estimated to save 5\'966 hours per designer each year, while creating a more scalable cross-brand foundation.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sl300\sa100\partightenfactor0
