\f0\b\fs48 \cf2 VM Home Movers Journey\
\pard\pardeftab720\sl300\sa100\partightenfactor0

\fs21 \cf2 Scope:
\f1\b0  Virgin Media web\uc0\u8232 
\f0\b Role:
\f1\b0  Product design, UX strategy and user research\uc0\u8232 
\f0\b Outcome:
\f1\b0  Redesigned the Movers homepage around behavioural data and customer research, targeting the 55% drop-off before postcode entry.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sl300\sa100\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs27 \cf2 The Challenge\
\pard\pardeftab720\sl300\sa100\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs21 \cf2 Only 45% of sessions progressed from the Movers homepage to postcode entry. Research also showed customers needed greater reassurance around availability, connectivity and what would happen during their move. My role was to understand the friction and use those findings to redesign the homepage and wider journey
\f0\b .
\f1\b0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sl300\sa100\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs27 \cf2 1. Analysed where customers were dropping out\
\pard\pardeftab720\sl300\sa100\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs21 \cf2 I combined Contentsquare behavioural data, Tableau funnel data and 2026 user research to understand where customers were struggling and what they needed before starting their move.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sl300\sa100\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs27 \cf2 2. Turned research into the homepage redesign\
\pard\pardeftab720\sl300\sa100\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs21 \cf2 Research showed the homepage felt lengthy and static, so I simplified the content hierarchy around customers\'92 main questions and actions. I also introduced simple motion design to make key moments more engaging and break up the experience.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sl300\sa100\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs27 \cf2 3. Looked beyond the homepage\
\pard\pardeftab720\sl300\sa100\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs21 \cf2 I used the same evidence to review the wider serviceability and booking journey. Funnel analysis showed only 15% of serviceable sessions went on to start the web booking journey, highlighting another point of friction to address.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sl300\sa100\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs27 \cf2 4. Tested and refined key decisions\
\pard\pardeftab720\sl300\sa100\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs21 \cf2 I ran further research to validate parts of the redesigned experience, including how faster broadband could be communicated without distracting customers from their move. 94% of 89 participants chose one of the two prominent green notification treatments, which informed the direction for further refinement.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sl300\sa100\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs27 \cf2 Outcome\
\pard\pardeftab720\sl300\sa100\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs21 \cf2 The work created an evidence-led redesign of the Movers homepage and wider journey, using behavioural data, customer research and testing to guide each design decision. The new direction targets the 55% drop-off before postcode entry, while creating a clearer path through serviceability and booking.}